Here is a simple template code for a basic web application using HTML and JavaScript that logs user inputs and stores them locally in plaintext using the browser's localStorage:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Input Logger</title>
